  "description": {
    "zh": "符号依次出现后消失，孩子凭记忆重建完整顺序。高等级增加更长序列、保持延迟和局部更新。",
    "en": "Symbols appear one at a time and disappear. The child reconstructs the complete order from memory, with longer sequences, retention delays and local updating at higher grades."
  },
  "designModel": {
    "zh": "K1 从两个符号的顺序保持开始，K2 增加到三个，G1 保持四个符号并延长等待，G2 在原序列消失后替换一个位置再重建。",
    "en": "K1 retains two symbols in order, K2 increases to three, G1 retains four across a longer delay, and G2 replaces one hidden position before reconstruction."
  },
