  "seriesBoundary": {
    "policyZh": "本模块要求符号逐个消失后重建实际展示顺序，不要求发现重复规律，因此属于记忆守护者而不是规律猎手。",
    "policyEn": "This module reconstructs the actual presented order after symbols disappear. It does not ask the child to discover a repeating rule, so it belongs to Memory Guardian rather than Pattern Hunter."
  },
